WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
THE GRAND DOLBY THEATRE
HAS BEEN HOME

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.520
TO THE ACADEMY AWARDS
SINCE 2002.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.040
AND WE'LL BE BACK HERE
AGAIN NEXT YEAR.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.120
BUT THE TIMES HAVE CALLED FOR A
PAUSE WHILE WE GRAPPLE WITH ALL

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.440
THE CHANGES AROUND US.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:22.320
THE TIMES ARE ALWAYS CHANGING OF
COURSE, BUT IT'S FASCINATING HOW

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.840
OFTEN THEY REPEAT THEMSELVES.
LET ME SET THIS SCENE.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.840
IT'S A RAGING TAIL
END OF A PANDEMIC.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:35.360
MANY MILLIONS OF LIVES ARE LOST.
MANY MILLIONS MORE PERMANENTLY

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.440
DISLOCATED AND CHANGED FOREVER.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.880
PEOPLE WONDER,
HOW WILL WE MOVE FORWARD?

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.840
THE YEAR IS 1921.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:48.480
AFTER THE WORST PANDEMIC IN
HISTORY, ACTORS MARY PICKFORD

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.240
AND JEAN HERSHOLT TOOK ACTION

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.240
RAISING MONEY FOR THE MOTION
PICTURE AND TELEVISION FUND

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.160
A FOUNDATION THAT WOULD
PROVIDE A REMARKABLE RANGE

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:01.360
OF HEALTH SERVICES AND
AID TO ANYONE WHO

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.440
WORKED IN THE FILM OR
TELEVISION INDUSTRY.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:08.640
100 YEARS LATER, WE FIND OURSELVES
IN ANOTHER GLOBAL PANDEMIC.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:12.480
THIS TIME, THE MPTF KNEW HOW TO
ANSWER THE CALL

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.600
BECAUSE THEY HAD BEEN
DOING IT FOR DECADES.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:21.120
IN 1942, THE MOTION PICTURE AND
TELEVISION FUND BROKE GROUND ON

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.120
WHAT WOULD BECOME THE
LEW WASSERMAN CAMPUS

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.320
IN WOODLAND HILLS.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:26.160
FROM ACTORS TO MAKE-UP ARTISTS.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:30.080
FROM ELECTRICIANS TO CARPENTERS.
FROM PAINTERS TO TEAMSTERS,

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:33.200
THE MOTION PICTURE AND TELEVISION
FUND WAS CREATED TO HELP THOSE

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:35.840
WHO, FOR WHATEVER REASON,
FELL ON HARD TIMES.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.360
THE FILM LAB CHEMIST WHO
DEVELOPED ALZHEIMER'S FOUND A

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.120
HOME AT THE MPTF.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:44.160
A GAY HAIR AND MAKE-UP ARTIST
WHOSE DEATH LEFT HIS LIFE

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:47.200
PARTNER UNABLE TO RECEIVE HIS
PENSION BECAUSE THEIR 40-YEAR

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.440
UNION WAS NOT RECOGNIZED
AS A MARRIAGE.

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:51.200
THE MPTF WAS THERE TO HELP.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:55.360
&gt;&gt; BEING A SINGLE MOTHER IN THIS
INDUSTRY IS HARD.

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:59.520
BUT HAVING MY SON LOSE HIS
FATHER MADE IT A LOT HARDER.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:02.160
BUT NAOMI AND MPTF
WERE THERE FOR US.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:06.240
&gt;&gt; MY FAMILY AND I WILL ALWAYS
REMEMBER THE GRACE WITH WHICH

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:09.920
MY HUSBAND TRAVIS DIED, AND THE
MOTION PICTURE TELEVISION FUND

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.520
THAT ALLOWED HIM TO DEFINE
THE TERMS OF HOW THAT HAPPENED.

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:16.320
&gt;&gt; I HAVE A SPECIAL
CONNECTION TO THE MPTF.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:19.280
WHEN MY MOTHER, PEGGY, A FORMER
ACTRESS, WAS DIAGNOSED WITH

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:22.800
ALZHEIMER'S, THE MPTF OFFERED
HER A CARING AND LOVING HOME FOR

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:26.400
HER FINAL YEARS, AS WELL AS HER
LAST SWEET ROMANCE.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:31.040
TODAY, OVER 250 RESIDENTS CALL
THE WASSERMAN CAMPUS THEIR HOME,

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.720
THEIR AGES RANGING FROM OVER
60 TO NEARLY 100.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:38.400
THESE GLORIOUS PEOPLE HOLD THE
HISTORY OF FILM AND TELEVISION

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.320
IN THEIR STORIES AND
EXPERIENCES.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:44.240
KEEPING THESE RESIDENTS SAFE
DURING COVID, SEEING TO THEIR

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:47.360
HEALTH NEEDS, KEEPING THEM
SOCIALLY DISTANCED AND SOCIALLY

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:50.160
CONNECTED WAS AN
OVERWHELMING CHALLENGE.

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:54.000
BUT THE MPTF STAFF AND VOLUNTEERS
NEVER LEFT THEIR SIDE.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.480
OFTEN SACRIFICING TIME
WITH THEIR OWN FAMILIES

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.240
TO TAKE CARE OF THE RESIDENTS.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.880
QUITE SIMPLY, THEY
ARE OUR HEROES,

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.840
WORKING BEYOND
THE CALL OF DUTY.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:08.800
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:13.360
IT'S THE 100TH ANNIVERSARY OF
THE MPTF AND WE HAVE WITH US

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:16.960
70 OF THOSE VACCINATED HEALTH
CARE AND SOCIAL WORKERS WHOSE

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:20.480
COMPASSION COMPELLED THEM TO
STEP UP AND TAKE ACTION TO HELP

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:23.280
THOSE IN NEED.
IT IS WITH INFINITE GRATITUDE

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:26.880
AND GREAT PRIDE, THAT WE
HONOR THEM ALL TONIGHT.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:30.960
ON BEHALF OF THE MOTION PICTURE AND
TELEVISION FUND, CEO BOB BEITCHER

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:38.410
IS HERE TO ACCEPT THIS YEAR'S
JEAN HERSHOLT HUMANITARIAN AWARD.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:50.480
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:53.200
BRYAN, THANK YOU FOR
THOSE KIND WORDS.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:57.600
THEY MEAN SO MUCH TO US, COMING
FROM A MEMBER OF OUR MPTF FAMILY.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:02.480
JENNIFER, NORMA, AND I WANT TO
EXPRESS OUR GRATITUDE TO

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:07.200
DAVID RUBIN, DAWN HUDSON, AND
THE ACADEMY BOARD OF GOVERNORS

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.640
FOR RECOGNIZING THE MOTION PICTURE
AND TELEVISION FUND TONIGHT

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:12.480
WITH THIS VERY SPECIAL HONOR.

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.960
ESPECIALLY SINCE THIS IS THE
FIRST TIME THE AWARD HAS GONE

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.257
TO AN ORGANIZATION.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:20.880
THANK YOU TO OUR BOARDS,
WHO HAVE GUIDED US

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:22.480
AND SUPPORTED US OVER THE YEARS.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:26.400
YOUR KIND WORDS DURING THE
PANDEMIC WERE CHERISHED.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:32.000
MUCH APPRECIATION TO THE THOUSANDS
OF SMALL AND LARGE DONORS WHO

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:36.640
SUSTAIN OUR CHARITY AND TO OUR
VOLUNTEERS WHOSE CONTRIBUTION

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:40.330
OF THEIR PERSONAL TIME
IS SO ESSENTIAL TO OUR MISSION.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.280
HERE'S TO THE TENS OF THOUSANDS

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:46.000
OF FREELANCE WORKERS IN OUR
ENTERTAINMENT COMMUNITY.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.520
THOSE IN FRONT OF
AND BEHIND THE CAMERA.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:54.160
THEY ARE THE HEARTBEAT OF OUR
INDUSTRY AND FOR 100 YEARS

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:57.120
MPTF HAS BEEN THEIR
SAFETY NET OF SUPPORT.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:01.440
THIS YEAR ALONE, MPTF
CONNECTED WITH OUR

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.720
INDUSTRY WORKFORCE
OVER 40,000 TIMES.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.200
THANK YOU TO THE RESIDENTS OF

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:11.040
THE ICONIC MOTION PICTURE HOME.
THEY'VE HAD A VERY ROUGH

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:16.640
12 MONTHS OF SOCIAL ISOLATION.
TONIGHT THOUGH, THEY'RE ALL TOGETHER,

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:20.080
BUT SOCIALLY DISTANCED AND
WATCHING THE OSCARS.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:26.080
TO NORMA CARRANZA, NURSE,
AND TO JENNIFER JORGE, SOCIAL WORKER,

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.600
BOTH OF WHOM EXEMPLIFY
THE BEST IN THEIR FIELDS,

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:33.440
AND TO THE REST OF OUR
MPTF WORK FAMILY

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:35.440
ON THE FRONT LINE
DURING THE PANDEMIC.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:40.400
THE SOCIAL WORKERS AND NURSES,
DOCTORS AND HOUSEKEEPERS,

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:45.840
ACTIVITY STAFF AND FOOD SERVERS,
ACCOUNTANTS, FUNDRAISERS,

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:50.160
I.T. TECHS, PRODUCERS,
H.R. PROFESSIONALS,

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.240
CHAPLAINS, COOKS,
AND LANDSCAPERS,

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:56.640
THEY ARE OUR INDUSTRY'S
SUPERHEROES OF 2020.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:02.960
THIS AWARD IS FOR THEM AND THE
TENS OF THOUSANDS OF OTHERS WHO

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:05.840
HAVE WORKED AT MPTF
OVER THE PAST 100 YEARS.

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:11.040
IT'S THE HONOR OF A
LIFETIME FOR ALL OF US

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:13.840
TO WORK TOGETHER AND TO
RECEIVE THIS AWARD.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:18.806
WE REALLY AND TRULY
TAKE CARE OF OUR OWN.

00:06:18.806 --> 00:06:25.280
AND TO JEAN HERSHOLT, HUMANITARIAN AND
OUR PRESIDENT AT MPTF FOR 18 YEARS,

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:30.000
WE'RE BRINGING YOU HOME TONIGHT.

